From e01452b95affefb2832bf9726e90fe8a59dd13d7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dalton Alexandre <alley.nightly_0b@icloud.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 08:48:06 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] soc: apple: Add an exclusive T8010 AOP DMA owner

Provide bounded coherent DMA and DT-described MMIO for the orientation
service. Stop the AOP before releasing buffers, retain allocations if it
cannot stop, and require a fresh boot after starting the core. Do not
expose arbitrary physical memory.

Signed-off-by: Dalton Alexandre <alley.nightly_0b@icloud.com>
---
